      "title": "Australia news live: Malcolm Turnbull says trusting Aukus is ‘stark staring bonkers’; Minns considers banning ebikes for under-12s",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/10/australia-news-live-transport-minister-sydney-airport-air-traffic-control-catherine-king-aukus-public-inquiry-malcolm-turnbull-alan-jones-trial-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Former PM has told a public inquiry the agreement will probably result in no submarines for Australia. Follow today’s news live</p><p>Police say the remains found in a suitcase near Goulburn are not human.</p><p>Supt <strong>Linda Bradbury</strong> with NSW police said:</p><p>Some good news here that we don’t have a suspicious death of a human on our hands. … We are still undertaking more forensic work to identify what they are. But we can identify that they’re not human.</p><p>But we’ve confirmed by other means that they are not.</p><p>The undersupply of housing combined with population growth is expected to partially offset the impact of higher interest rates and recent federal government policy changes on the housing market.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/10/australia-news-live-transport-minister-sydney-airport-air-traffic-control-catherine-king-aukus-public-inquiry-malcolm-turnbull-alan-jones-trial-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-10T00:38:04"
    },
    {
      "title": "China expresses ‘grave concern’ as internal documents reveal suicide warning before death in Melbourne immigration detention",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/10/woman-who-took-her-own-life-in-melbourne-detention-centre-was-known-suicide-risk-documents-reveal-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p><strong>Exclusive:</strong> Serious questions raised about whether Chinese citizen was properly monitored at centre run by US prison giant</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/10/australia-news-live-transport-minister-sydney-airport-air-traffic-control-catherine-king-aukus-public-inquiry-malcolm-turnbull-alan-jones-trial-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The US private prison company running Australia’s immigration detention system was warned that a newly detained Chinese citizen expressed suicidal ideation and had a history of self-harm less than 24 hours before she died by suicide in a Melbourne detention centre, internal documents show.</p><p>The death has raised serious questions about whether the detainee was properly monitored and whether she was placed in an appropriate room, given her state of mind.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/10/woman-who-took-her-own-life-in-melbourne-detention-centre-was-known-suicide-risk-documents-reveal-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
